   prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/CLV>
 ] .


###  https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/name
l0:name rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
        rdfs:isDefinedBy l0: ;
        l0:controlledVocabulary <https://w3id.org/italia/controlled-vocabulary/territorial-classifications/cities> ,
                                <https://w3id.org/italia/controlled-vocabulary/territorial-classifications/provinces> ,
